        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Mage-Flow- Text to Image\n\nGenerate high-resolution images from text prompts using Mage-Flow, a compact 4B-parameter diffusion model that outputs a single image at native resolutions from 512 to 2048 pixels per side. Ideal for rapid concept visualization, creative asset generation, and research in controlled image synthesis under limited compute budgets. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_mage_flow_t2i_int8.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
